# Transient scratch files written by spec rows / example programs that run
# with this directory as their working directory (e.g. a row that writes a
# file to a bare relative path). These are tiny test outputs, never source:
# every real file here is a *.go test or COMPILED_STATUS.md, so ignoring
# single-character filenames is safe and keeps `git status` (and the
# stop-hook clean-tree check) quiet after a test run.
